{"t": 1792880161257, "cmd": "note", "args": ["Founding a settlement took 4 attempts (ticks 4649->7301, ~53 game s) because AI nations kept founding camps in the very 'open ground' the rejection hint pointed to (Yellowport, Northville, then Westford founded at tick 6453 right where I headed). Hint direction is given as compass words (south, south-east, north-west) but there is no compass or north indicator on screen, so a player cannot tell which way south is. Screenshot found3.png."]}
{"t": 1792880161325, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "found4", "After founding, the settlement's floating label ('0 here, 1/8 residents') renders huge and sits behind/over the top HUD toasts and chronicle, half off-screen. tick 7321"]}
