{"t": 1792881172505, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "inv4", "Recruiting balance/feedback: the Members 10 gate requires poaching pawns from AI nations (no unaffiliated settlers found) by gifting them up through Stranger->Acquaintance->Friend->Loyal, ~6-8 gifts each (10 coins or 1 apple per gift). Gifts keep being accepted after a pawn is already Loyal (second apple to Harriet Roberts wasted, tick ~31800), and Frank Wilson accepted gifts all the way to Loyal and only then said 'Fortresstown is my home... (Loyal by nature)' - the trait that makes him unrecruitable is not warned about before spending. Pawns also wander out of reach between gifts. tick 31875"]}
